WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.177
Annie and her family were enjoying dessert.

2
00:00:08.178 --> 00:00:11.487
Everyone loved Mother's chocolate almond cake.

3
00:00:11.488 --> 00:00:14.610
But Annie was not feeling well.

4
00:00:14.611 --> 00:00:20.119
"Mom, can I save my piece for tomorrow?" she asked.

5
00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:25.095
"Annie, are you sure you want to save your cake?" asked Dad.

6
00:00:25.096 --> 00:00:29.890
"What if it spoils?" asked her sister Molly.

7
00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:34.843
"It won't taste good tomorrow," said Jesse, one of the twins.

8
00:00:34.844 --> 00:00:39.808
"What if you're still sick tomorrow?" said Jake, the other twin.

9
00:00:39.809 --> 00:00:47.760
"Please do not touch my cake!" Annie said.

10
00:00:47.761 --> 00:00:53.617
"Good morning! How are you feeling?" asked Mother the next morning.

11
00:00:53.618 --> 00:00:57.024
"I feel great!" answered Annie.

12
00:00:57.025 --> 00:01:00.100
Annie opened the refrigerator door.

13
00:01:00.101 --> 00:01:07.688
"Oh no!" she shouted. "My cake is gone!

14
00:01:07.689 --> 00:01:10.977
Who ate my cake?" she asked.

15
00:01:10.978 --> 00:01:14.091
"Not me," said Molly.

16
00:01:14.092 --> 00:01:17.367
"It wasn't me," said Jesse.

17
00:01:17.368 --> 00:01:20.965
"Don't look at me," said Jake.

18
00:01:20.966 --> 00:01:24.926
Annie's parents shrugged their shoulders.

19
00:01:24.927 --> 00:01:29.153
"One of you is not telling the truth," Annie said.

20
00:01:29.154 --> 00:01:32.227
"Someone in this room ate my cake!

21
00:01:32.228 --> 00:01:37.218
And I am going to find out who did it!"

22
00:01:37.219 --> 00:01:40.749
Annie asked her family to leave the kitchen.

23
00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:45.973
She wanted to search the area for clues.

24
00:01:45.974 --> 00:01:49.182
There were no dishes or cups in the sink.

25
00:01:49.183 --> 00:01:51.353
It was very clean.

26
00:01:51.354 --> 00:01:53.433
Annie opened the cupboard.

27
00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:57.068
One of the cups was missing.

28
00:01:57.069 --> 00:02:00.123
Annie opened the lid to the garbage can.

29
00:02:00.124 --> 00:02:03.038
She found the wrapper from her cake.

30
00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:07.419
There was also a fresh banana peel.

31
00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:12.098
Annie asked everyone to meet her in the living room.

32
00:02:12.099 --> 00:02:17.143
"I would like to ask you some questions," announced Annie.

33
00:02:17.144 --> 00:02:19.132
"Let's start with you, Dad.

34
00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:22.439
What time did you go to sleep last night?"

35
00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:25.579
"About eleven," he answered.

36
00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.351
"Did you wake up during the night?"

37
00:02:28.352 --> 00:02:34.551
"Yes, I did. I went to the bathroom," he said.

38
00:02:34.552 --> 00:02:39.190
"Did you wake up during the night?" Annie asked her mother.

39
00:02:39.191 --> 00:02:42.113
"I woke up twice," she answered.

40
00:02:42.114 --> 00:02:48.023
"Once when your father got up, and the other time was about six o'clock."

41
00:02:48.024 --> 00:02:51.482
"What woke you up then?" Annie asked.

42
00:02:51.483 --> 00:02:56.027
"I thought I heard a sound from the kitchen."

43
00:02:56.028 --> 00:03:00.100
"I got up at about twelve because I was thirsty.

44
00:03:00.101 --> 00:03:03.745
I drank some milk," Molly said.

45
00:03:03.746 --> 00:03:08.159
"Where is your cup?" Annie asked her sister.

46
00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.620
Molly got up and left the living room.

47
00:03:11.621 --> 00:03:17.099
"I went to sleep at ten and woke up at eight this morning," said Jesse.

48
00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:23.039
"So I couldn't have eaten your cake, unless I was sleepwalking."

49
00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.746
Molly returned and gave a cup to Annie.

50
00:03:26.747 --> 00:03:30.188
It was the missing cup from the cupboard.

51
00:03:30.189 --> 00:03:34.447
"Did you get up during the night?" she asked Jake.

52
00:03:34.448 --> 00:03:39.309
"No, uh, wait, yes, I did," he said.

53
00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:42.751
"What time was that?" asked Annie.

54
00:03:42.752 --> 00:03:46.617
"Uh, I think it was about one or two."

55
00:03:46.618 --> 00:03:48.977
"Why did you get up?"

56
00:03:48.978 --> 00:03:55.325
"I was hungry. So, uh, I ate a banana," said Jake.

57
00:03:55.326 --> 00:03:57.645
Annie looked at her notebook.

58
00:03:57.646 --> 00:04:01.741
"I know who ate my cake," she announced.

59
00:04:01.742 --> 00:04:04.185
Annie looked at each person.

60
00:04:04.186 --> 00:04:07.516
Then her eyes rested on Jake.

61
00:04:07.517 --> 00:04:10.839
"It was Jake."

62
00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:14.640
"H-h-how did you know?" he asked.

63
00:04:14.641 --> 00:04:20.573
Annie explained. "Mom said she heard a noise around six in the morning.

64
00:04:20.574 --> 00:04:23.890
Someone must have been up at that time.

65
00:04:23.891 --> 00:04:27.914
But my biggest clue was the banana peel.

66
00:04:27.915 --> 00:04:33.895
If you ate the banana around one or two, the peel would already be dark.

67
00:04:33.896 --> 00:04:37.800
But when I saw it, it was still yellow.

68
00:04:37.801 --> 00:04:41.238
That's how I knew you were lying."

69
00:04:41.239 --> 00:04:44.179
Jake admitted that he ate Annie's cake.

70
00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.354
He apologized to Annie.

71
00:04:46.355 --> 00:04:51.665
No one knew Annie was such a good detective!
